  "historyNote": "#7972, eff 10-17-03 (See Revision Note #1 at chapter heading for Saf-C 500); ss by #9995, INTERIM, eff 9-17-11, EXPIRED: 3-15-12 New. #10135, eff 5-23-12; ss by #13521, eff 1-13-23 (formerly Saf-C 515.07)",
